      "Return ENOSYS (38) for clone3 so glibc falls back to reviewed clone user-namespace rules. No allow-all action.",
      "Allow chroot without an OCI capability condition: Chromium obtains CAP_SYS_CHROOT in its own user namespace after container startup; Docker otherwise filters out this syscall when cap_drop is ALL. Host capabilities remain dropped and kernel capability checks still apply."
